      "name": "OpenMeter Apps",
      "description": {
        "content": "Apps enable you to extend and customize billing and usage workflows by integrating with external systems and services. Apps can automate and enhance your billing ecosystem by supporting capabilities such as synchronizing usage data with third-party platforms, calculating taxes, generating and delivering invoices, handling payment collection, and other billing-related tasks.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
